        let responses = [
            "The baseball card market has been quite dynamic lately! Rookie cards from the early 1990s are seeing renewed interest. Based on your collection, I'd suggest focusing on high-grade examples of key players from that era.",
            "Market timing is crucial in card collecting. Right now, I'm seeing strong demand for graded cards, especially PSA 9s and 10s. If you have raw cards in excellent condition, it might be worth considering professional grading.",
